  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing anti-corruption reforms in Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the national level, this project aims to utilize insights from the implementer&apos;s ongoing partnership with government authorities to inform and empower civil society actors, in line with the National Anti-Corruption Strategy and UNCAC article 13 on Participation of society. At the state level, this project aims to meet the unique capacity building needs for the state of Sarawak to advance its anti-corruption reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
